      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, thanks. I like the tone. Can you make it a bit more personal? Maybe include a line about how we'll keep his resume on file for future openings, and could you also suggest a way to phrase the \"not a fit right now\" part so it doesn't sound too harsh or blunt?",
